---
import Container from '../primitives/Container.astro';
import Link from '../typography/Link.astro';
---
<section class="about-home density-quiet" aria-labelledby="about-home-title" data-density="quiet"><Container><p class="about-kicker">NOTE.04 / ABOUT</p><div class="about-grid"><div><h2 id="about-home-title">I’m usually most interested in the moment when a product problem stops being just a design problem or just an engineering problem.</h2><p>That middle space is where I like to work.</p><Link href="/about" variant="arrow">About me</Link></div><strong>Building technology<br />that feels<br />considered.</strong></div></Container></section>
<style>
  .about-home { min-height:105svh; display:grid; align-items:center; border-top:1px solid var(--color-border); }.about-kicker { color:var(--color-muted); font:500 var(--type-meta) var(--font-mono); letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; }.about-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr); gap:var(--grid-gap); margin-top:3rem; }.about-grid > div { grid-column:1 / span 4; align-self:start; }.about-grid h2 { font:400 var(--type-heading)/1.08 var(--font-serif); letter-spacing:-.02em; text-wrap:pretty; }.about-grid p { margin-top:1.5rem; color:var(--color-muted); font-size:var(--type-lead); }.about-grid :global(.link) { margin-top:2rem; }.about-grid > strong { grid-column:6 / span 7; align-self:end; font:560 var(--type-display-lg)/.91 var(--font-sans); letter-spacing:-.04em; text-transform:uppercase; text-wrap:balance; }
  @media (max-width:640px) { .about-home { min-height:auto; }.about-grid { display:block; }.about-grid > strong { display:block; margin-top:6rem; font-size:clamp(3rem,14vw,4.5rem); } }
</style>
